{
  "file_id": "3551",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 150,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "The fake sign's ready! Heeheehee!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13160,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡El cartel falso listo! ¡Jijiji!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Soon the Chosen Child will appear,\nsee the sign, and fall right into\nmy trap!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13194,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "¡Pronto el Niño Elegido aparecerá,\nverá el cartel y caerá en\nmi trampa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I have to do something, or else\nLord Myotismon will...",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13272,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Debo hacer algo, o el Amo\nMyotismon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Izzy, can we rest for a bit?\nI'm dead tired.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13326,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¿paramos un rato?\nEstoy muerto de cansancio."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We have to find Gennai as soon as\npossible!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13376,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Debemos encontrar a Gennai\ncuanto antes!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "But it's already been two months.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13420,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Pero ya han pasado dos meses."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I'll keep going, no matter how\nmany months it takes.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13454,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Seguiré adelante, sin importar\ncuántos meses tarde."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Izzy! Wait for meeeeeee!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13507,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡Izzy! ¡Esperaaaaame!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "If we meet Gennai, we can learn\nthe secret behind the Crests!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13537,
      "_bytes": 61,
      "translation": "¡Si vemos a Gennai, sabremos\nel secreto de los Emblemas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "You know, Izzy, the fact that\nyou're always curious is what I \nlike about you.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13599,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "¿Sabes, Izzy? Lo que me gusta\nde ti es que siempre eres\ntan curioso."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Stop, I'm getting embarrassed.\nAnyway, where's Gennai?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13683,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Para, que me da vergüenza.\nBueno, ¿dónde está Gennai?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "But we didn't even take a break!\nIzzy!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13738,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Pero si no hemos descansado\nnada! ¡Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Ah! It's a sign.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13782,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Ah! Un cartel."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "\"Beware of Falling Poop Ahead\"...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13799,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "\"Cuidado, caca cayendo\"..."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "What's this?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13833,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Qué es esto?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Huh? If it says that, then we\nshould take a detour.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13846,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¿Eh? Si dice eso, mejor\ndamos un rodeo."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Heeheeheehee!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13898,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Jijijiji!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "This area really is full of poop.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13912,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Esta zona está llena de caca."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "I wanna get through this mountain\nas quickly as we can!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13946,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¡Quiero cruzar esta montaña\nlo antes posible!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "But these signs are a huge help.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14002,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Estos carteles ayudan mucho."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Ah! Another sign!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14035,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¡Otro cartel!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Seems like this time we should go\nthis way instead.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14053,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Parece que esta vez hay que\nir por aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Ah! Uwaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14105,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¡Uaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "W-Waaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14122,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Guaaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I did it, I did it! A great\nsuccess!!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14138,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Lo logré, lo logré! ¡¡Todo\nun éxito!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14176,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14189,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Can't you fly, Tentomon?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14202,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¿No vuelas, Tentomon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I can't fly! Tryin' to fly just\nmakes me fall right back down!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14227,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "¡No puedo volar! ¡Si lo intento,\nsolo consigo caer de nuevo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "How far are we going to keep\nfalling?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14290,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¿Hasta cuándo vamos a seguir\ncayendo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "To Hell.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14328,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "Al Infierno."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Hell? Don't mess with us!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14337,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¿Infierno? ¡No juegues!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "No! I don't wanna go to Hell!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14363,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¡No! ¡No quiero ir al Infierno!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Those who are possessed by greed\nwill fall into Hell.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14393,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Los poseídos por la codicia\ncaerán al Infierno."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "I don't believe we're possessed by\nany type of greed, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14447,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "No creo que tengamos codicia\nde ningún tipo, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "No, you are possessed, by the\ngreed of wanting to know\neverything.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14508,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "No, estás poseído por la\ncodicia de querer saberlo\ntodo."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "No way!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14575,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Qué va!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Do you want to fall into Hell?!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14583,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡¿Quieres caer al Infierno?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "I don't want to faaaaaaaaaaall!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14615,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡No quiero caeeeeeeeeeer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I don't, either!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14647,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Yo tampoco!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Then throw away your inquisitive\nheart!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14664,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Entonces tira tu corazón\ncurioso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "But Izzy, that's what I like\nabout you...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14704,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Pero Izzy, eso es lo que me\ngusta de ti..."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "But at this rate we're both going\nto fall into Hell!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14751,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "¡Pero a este paso los dos\ncaeremos al Infierno!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14804,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "How do I throw it away?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14817,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¿Y cómo lo tiro yo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Pray for it!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14841,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Rezando!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I don't want to know! I don't want\nto know!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14854,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡No quiero saber! ¡No quiero\nsaber!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Where in tarnation are we?!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14898,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡¿Dónde diablos estamos?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "The Sacred Mysterious Universe.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14926,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "El Sagrado Universo Misterioso."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "A-aaaaaaaaah.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14958,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "A-aaaaaaaaah."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14972,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Quién eres?"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "I am Vadermon, the ruler of the\nSacred Mysterious Universe.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14985,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Soy Vademon, gobernante del\nSagrado Universo Misterioso."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Vadermon...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15045,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "Vademon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I will dispose of the inquisitive\nheart that you've discarded.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15057,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Me desharé del corazón curioso\nque has descartado."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15120,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "It is much more important to\nacquire Cosmic Power.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15133,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Es mucho más importante\nobtener el Poder Cósmico."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "...much more important to acquire\nCosmic Power...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15184,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "...mucho más importante tener\nel Poder Cósmico..."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Just like that. Heeheehee...",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15234,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Así, muy bien. Jijiji..."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "The fundamentals of Cosmic Power\nlie in your breathing.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15263,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "La base del Poder Cósmico está\nen tu respiración."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Izzy, don't get sucked into\nthat hogwash!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15319,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¡no te tragues esas\ntonterías!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "The correct way to breathe is to\ngenerate alpha rays from your\nright chest...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15366,
      "_bytes": 77,
      "translation": "La forma correcta de respirar es\ngenerar rayos alfa desde tu\npecho derecho..."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Stop it!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15444,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Para ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Continue your training!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15453,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡Sigue entrenando!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Yes. A...B...C...D...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15477,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Sí. A...B...C...D..."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Huh? Did I dig the pit that deep?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15499,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¿Eh? ¿Cavé el hoyo tan hondo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "I still haven't gotten the Crest.\nWhat do I do...?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15533,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "Aún no tengo el Emblema.\n¿Qué hago...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Hm, hmmmmm! I've obtained a good\nheart today.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15584,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Hmm, hmmmmm! Hoy conseguí un\nbuen corazón."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "!!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15630,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Excuse me, have you seen a human\nand a Digimon fall into this hole\nanytime recently?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15633,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Disculpe, ¿ha visto caer por aquí\na un humano y un Digimon\nhace poco?"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I saw them, I saw them! Please\nwait a moment!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15718,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "¡Los vi, los vi! ¡Espere un\nmomento, por favor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Sorry to keep you waiting! Here's\nthat kid's inquisitive heart!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15764,
      "_bytes": 63,
      "translation": "¡Perdón por la espera! ¡Aquí tiene\nel corazón curioso del chaval!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "...his heart?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15828,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "...¿su corazón?"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "I'm the Merchant of the Heart\nUniverse. Haven't you come to buy\na heart?",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15842,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Soy el Mercader del Universo\nde los Corazones. ¿No viene\na comprar uno?"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "No, I want the Tag and Crest that\nkid was holding!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15915,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡No, quiero el Circuito y Emblema\nde ese chaval!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Good sir, this is a heart shop! I\ndon't sell that kind of thing!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15966,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Buen hombre, esto es una tienda\nde corazones! ¡No vendo eso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "But I've got a fine poop for you.",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16031,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Pero le traigo una buena caca."
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "A poop?! That's respectable!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16065,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡¿Una caca?! ¡Qué honor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I'd like to trade with you, you\nknow!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16094,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Quisiera comerciar con\nusted, ¿sabe?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "I'll do it! I'll do it!!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16132,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Lo haré! ¡¡Lo haré!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "E...F...G...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16157,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "E...F...G..."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16170,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "H...I...J...K...L...M...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16183,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "H...I...J...K...L...M..."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "There's something I'd like to tell\nyou.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16208,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Hay algo que quiero\ndecirte."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "What's it *this* time?!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16248,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "¡¿Y ahora qué toca?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "To use Cosmic Power, you must\nthrow everything away.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16272,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Para usar el Poder Cósmico,\ndebes tirarlo todo."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Everything?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16325,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¿Todo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Hand over all of your personal\nbelongings.",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16337,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Entrega todas tus\npertenencias personales."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Yes. I don't need this.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16380,
      "_bytes": 23,
      "translation": "Sí. No necesito esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Aaaaah! You can't do that!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16404,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Aaaah! ¡Eso no se hace!"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Stay quiet!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16431,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Cállate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16443,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Heeheehee! Now, the Crest!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16453,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Jijiji! ¡Ahora, el Emblema!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Izzy! Get yourself together!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16480,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Izzy! ¡Espabila!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Tento...mon...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16514,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Tento...mon..."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16529,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Tentomon...what was I...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16540,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Tentomon... ¿qué hacía...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Tch! You're back to normal!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16565,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Tch! ¡Volviste en ti!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Izzy, you're right back to\nnormal! Huh? Power's flowin'\nthrough me!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16593,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Izzy, ¡ya vuelves a ser tú!\n¿Eh? ¡Siento un montón de\npoder recorriéndome!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "You think you can defeat me?",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16666,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¿Crees que puedes vencerme?"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Gaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 2431,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16695,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Gaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Kabuterimon!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16705,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Kabuterimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "This is bad! I ain't got enough\npower yet!",
      "speaker_id": 2431,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16718,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¡Mal asunto! ¡Aún no tengo\npoder suficiente!"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "If I could get back my inquisitive\nheart...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16761,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "Si pudiera recuperar mi\ncorazón curioso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "The inquisitive heart is mine!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16805,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡El corazón curioso es mío!"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "My curiosity is an important part\nof me. I want to know. I want to\nknow!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16836,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Mi curiosidad es parte\nimportante de mí. Quiero saber.\n¡Quiero saber!"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Aaaaaaah! You stole the\ninquisitive heart!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16909,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaah! ¡Robaste el\ncorazón curioso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Kabuterimon, get up! We'll\ncontinue our adventure together!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 16952,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Kabuterimon, ¡levántate!\n¡Seguiremos la aventura juntos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Izzy! What's going on? I'm\ngettin' a ton of energy!",
      "speaker_id": 2431,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17012,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "¡Izzy! ¿Qué pasa? ¡Estoy\nsintiendo un montón de energía!"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "You evolved with the power of the\nCrest, AtlurKabuterimon!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17069,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "¡Evolucionaste con el poder del\nEmblema, MegaKabuterimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "What is this? But just bluffing\nyour way through won't defeat me!",
      "speaker_id": 4251,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17128,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "¿Qué es esto? ¡Pero un farol no\nbastará para vencerme!"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "We did it, Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 2441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17194,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Lo logramos, Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "AtlurKabuterimon!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17216,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡MegaKabuterimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Is that the exit?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17234,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¿Es esa la salida?"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Let's get outta here!",
      "speaker_id": 2441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17252,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Vámonos de aquí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17274,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "He's taking so long. What's that\nVadermon guy doing?",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17280,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Tarda mucho. ¿Qué hace ese\ntal Vademon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "What?!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17333,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "We're out, Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 2441,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17340,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Fuera al fin, Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "Eeeeeeeeek!",
      "speaker_id": 4221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17362,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Eeeeeeeeek!"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "He left. Who was that Digimon?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17374,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Se fue. ¿Quién era ese Digimon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "I used up way too much energy.",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17405,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "Gasté demasiada energía."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "Thank you so much, Mochimon!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17436,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Muchas gracias, Motimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Izzy...",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17465,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "Izzy..."
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17478,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Matt! T.K!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17489,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Matt! ¡T.K.!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Tsunomon and Patamon!",
      "speaker_id": 2411,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17505,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Tsunomon y Patamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "Are you doing okay?",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17527,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¿Estáis bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17547,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "Chosen Children...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17552,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Niños Elegidos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Gennai!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17571,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Gennai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "The distortions in this world have\nnot been corrected yet.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17579,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Las distorsiones de este mundo\naún no se han corregido."
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "No way.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17638,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "No puede ser."
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "I'm counting on you, Chosen\nChildren...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17646,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "Cuento con vosotros, Niños\nElegidos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "Not again. He only says what's\nconvenient...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17686,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "Otra vez no. Solo dice lo que\nle conviene..."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "Let's meet up with everyone again.\nWe'll find a way if we work\ntogether!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17731,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "Reunámonos con todos.\n¡Encontraremos la forma si\ntrabajamos juntos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17804,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Sí, tienes razón!"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "\"Beware of extreme poop ahead!\"\nWhat's extreme poop?",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17824,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "\"¡Cuidado, caca extrema\ndelante!\" ¿Qué es caca extrema?"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "I don't really know, but I don't\nwanna get attacked by some poop.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17877,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Ni idea, pero no quiero que\nme ataque ninguna caca."
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Let's not go in that direction.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17943,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "Mejor no vayamos por ahí."
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "\"Beware of giant poop ahead\".",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17975,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "\"Cuidado, caca gigante ahí\"."
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "You worried about giant poop?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18005,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "¿Te preocupa la caca gigante?"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "Not \"worried\" per se, but let's\nkeep going.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18035,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "No es que me \"preocupe\", pero\nsigamos."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "\"Beware of a bottomless pit of\npoop ahead\".",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18079,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "\"Cuidado, foso sin fondo\nde caca delante\"."
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Don't like the sound of that one.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18123,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "Ese no me gusta nada."
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "We should take a detour.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18157,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "Mejor damos un rodeo."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "Izzy, I'm sick of all this\npoop.",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18182,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Izzy, estoy harto de tanta\ncaca."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "Indeed. Let's keep going.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18220,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Cierto. Sigamos."
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "Izzy, you ain't interested in\npoop, are you?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18246,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "Izzy, a ti no te interesa la\ncaca, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "I'm not interested in poop, but\nwhen a sign tells us not to go,\nit concerns me.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18296,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "No me interesa la caca, pero\nsi un cartel dice que no vayamos,\nme preocupa."
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "Is this your inquisitive heart?",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 18376,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¿Es este tu corazón curioso?"
    }
  ]
}